From 22b4160caba91324f4b6b014a49a2a6b5a9b611c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fab <faibiantorrestech@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 02:17:34 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app blocker): growing wait between unlocks and emergency
 unlock

App groups can now make you wait after each unlock before the next one:
1, 2, 3 minutes and so on (first wait, step and longest wait per group).
The wait starts when the unlock ends (for "on each open", when you leave
the apps) and starts over at a per weekday "day end" time.

An optional emergency password unlocks a group right away, skipping the
wait, limits and challenges, a set number of times per day. It does not
grow the wait.

Gap state lives in the app blocker service process. The day end times
and password are a new gated setting (UNLOCK_GAP), so weaker changes
wait out the settings change delay.

